@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed separate deployment approval and target-effect reconciliation
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Authorized approver" as A
participant "Deployment coordinator" as C
participant "Artifact / authority contracts" as F
database "Intent / approval / attempt state" as DB
participant "Trusted target adapter" as T
A -> C : approve exact artifact / target / configuration / recovery plan
C -> F : validate current authority + usable artifact + provenance
F --> C : exact eligible context or denial
C -> DB : guard approval inputs + target generation; commit intent
DB --> C : stable deployment attempt or conflict
alt admitted exact target intent
 C -> T : scoped dispatch with stable attempt identity
 alt confirmed target observations
  T --> C : applied version + health / data effect evidence
  C -> DB : record actual confirmed / failed / partial result
 else lost response / uncertain effect
  C -> DB : preserve unknown effect; block incompatible repeat
  C -> T : reconcile same attempt and actual target state
  T --> C : attributable observations or still unresolved
  C -> DB : retain evidence-supported outcome
 end
 C --> A : actual outcome; recovery is separately evaluated
else denied / stale approval / unavailable
 C --> A : no admitted deployment
end
note over C,T
 Local commit does not prove remote success or rollback.
 No blind resend after an unknown effect.
 Older code cannot automatically undo irreversible data changes.
end note
@enduml
